<Text>% Run Analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;runanalysis(&apos;IdentifyWaveform Analysis&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;BandwidthTable = [128 256 512 1024 1536 2048];&#x000D;&#x000A;N_RB_Table = [6 15 25 50 75 100];&#x000D;&#x000A;Base_DFTSize = BandwidthTable(Bandwidth+1);&#x000D;&#x000A;DFTSize=Base_DFTSize*(2^OversamplingOption);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;if_flag = hasvariable( &apos;IdentifyWaveform Analysis_Data&apos;, &apos;BBData&apos;)&#x000D;&#x000A;if if_flag==1&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;using(&apos;IdentifyWaveform Analysis_Data&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;SigRMS = sqrt(mean(abs(BBData).^2));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;SigMax = max(abs(BBData));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;if InputSignal==3&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;SigRMS = SigRMS/DFTSize;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;SigMax = SigMax/DFTSize;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;end&#x000D;&#x000A;end</Text>
