<Item XName="f_AutoRange" UserName="f_AutoRange" Type="function">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>function Att = f_AutoRange(PrimAddress, FCarrier, SamplingRate, MeasTime)&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;cd(getworkspacedir);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;agInstallCommandSets(&apos;Initilize.iseq&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;[r, a] = agRunSequence(&apos;Initilize.iseq&apos;, PrimAddress, double(FCarrier), double(SamplingRate), double(MeasTime));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Att =20;% Assume in this Att, no overflow&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Flag = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;while Flag == 0 &amp;&amp; Att&gt;2&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Att = Att-2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Flag = agRunSequence(&apos;overflow.iseq&apos;, PrimAddress, Att);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Flag = agRunSequence(&apos;overflow.iseq&apos;, PrimAddress, Att);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Flag_vec = de2bi(Flag);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Flag = Flag_vec(5);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Att= Att+2;&#x000D;&#x000A;end</Text>
